  },
  "notes": "The 180 x 180 mm canonical surface build stays at 0.20 mm/pixel (127 PPI). A supplied square-pixel image keeps its natural physical aspect: the configured 180 mm tile width derives its height uniformly (steel1.png becomes 180 x 120 mm). The Manifold3D adapter extracts that periodic tile and samples it at the separately parameterized 0.30 mm geometry pitch without tonal thresholding."
